3	
4	/**
5	 * The vocabulary corpus is not uniformly IPA — some entries are already
6	 * Paiboon, some are a partial mix of both, and a few are neither. Only
7	 * entries classified `"ipa"` are ever converted. See
8	 * `scripts/convert-romanization.py`, which performs the actual one-time
9	 * migration of `vocabulary.json`; this module mirrors its classification and
10	 * conversion rules for the app (and its tests) to reason about the result.
11	 */
